# TastyGo - Docker & Jenkins CI/CD

A DevOps practice project based on my TastyGo web application.

## Project Overview

This project demonstrates how I containerized a React/Vite application using Docker and integrated it with Jenkins for a basic CI/CD pipeline.

### What I implemented

- Containerized the TastyGo application using Docker
- Created a multi-stage Dockerfile
- Used Nginx to serve the production build
- Built and tested the Docker image locally
- Created a Jenkins Pipeline
- Connected Jenkins with GitHub
- Automated Docker image building and container deployment

