## CI/CD Workflow

```text
GitHub
   ↓
Jenkins
   ↓
Checkout Code
   ↓
Build Docker Image
   ↓
Stop Old Container
   ↓
Run New Container
   ↓
TastyGo Application

Docker
Build Docker Image
docker build -t tastygo:latest .
Run Docker Container
docker run -d --name tastygo-app -p 8083:80 tastygo:latest
Check Container
docker ps
Local Application
http://localhost:8083
Jenkins Pipeline

The Jenkins pipeline performs the following stages:

Checkout source code from GitHub
Build the Docker image
Stop the existing TastyGo container
Remove the old container
Start a new TastyGo container
